        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Mosiah 11:6",
        "book": "Mosiah",
        "chapter": 11,
        "verse": 6
      },
      {
        "text": "Yea, and they also became idolatrous, because they were deceived by the vain and flattering words of the king and priests; for they did speak flattering things unto them.",
